---
// Team — the founder and crew, polaroids on the bench.
---
<section id="maker" class="relative bg-paper-deep/40">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-20">
      <!-- Polaroids -->
      <div class="reveal order-2 md:order-1">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 items-start gap-5 sm:gap-6">
          <div
            class="relative -rotate-2 bg-card p-3 pb-10 shadow-[0_18px_40px_-16px_rgb(28_26_22/0.3)] transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0"
          >
            <div class="tape -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -rotate-2"></div>
            <img
              src="/images/supian.webp"
              alt="Supian M., founder of Octopy"
              class="aspect-square w-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <p class="mt-3 text-center font-hand text-xl text-ink-soft">
              supian &mdash; founder
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="relative mt-8 rotate-1 bg-card p-3 pb-10 shadow-[0_18px_40px_-16px_rgb(28_26_22/0.3)] transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0"
          >
            <div class="tape -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rotate-3"></div>
            <img
              src="/images/yulia.webp"
              alt="Yulia Susanti, operations at Octopy"
              class="aspect-square w-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <p class="mt-3 text-center font-hand text-xl text-ink-soft">
              yulia &mdash; operations
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bio -->
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <p
          class="reveal flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-faint uppercase"
        >
          <span class="inline-block h-px w-10 bg-ink/30"></span>
          Station 06 &mdash; The team
        </p>
        <h2
          class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl"
          style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
        >
          Led by the <em class="font-light">people.</em>
        </h2>

        <div
          class="reveal mt-6 space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"
          style="--reveal-delay: 170ms"
        >
          <p>
            Octopy was founded by Supian M., an engineer who works the stack end to end
            &mdash; Laravel and Go backends above, hardened Linux infrastructure below.
          </p>
          <p>
            His systems serve real people every day: the billing backend behind PDAM Intan
            Banjar&rsquo;s customer app, and SIOPEN, the government procurement marketplace
            running in two regencies. In open source, he maintains
            <a
              href="https://github.com/octopyid/laravel-impersonate"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-pen underline decoration-pen/40 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ink"
              >laravel-impersonate</a
            > &mdash; 300+ stars on GitHub &mdash; alongside Laravel packages used in
            production.
          </p>
          <p>
            Octopy exists for one reason: software that runs so quietly you forget
            it&rsquo;s there.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="reveal mt-9 space-y-5" style="--reveal-delay: 250ms">
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <i class="ph-duotone ph-stack mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-2xl text-marker"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-ink">Full-lifecycle ownership</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Application, server, mail, monitoring &mdash; one studio owns the whole thing.
                When something breaks, there&rsquo;s exactly one team to call.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <i class="ph-duotone ph-scales mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-2xl text-marker"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-ink">Pragmatic architecture</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Stacks a small team can run for years. No resume-driven choices, no cleverness
                you&rsquo;ll regret later.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <i class="ph-duotone ph-code mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-2xl text-marker"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-ink">Open source, maintained</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Our packages are production dependencies for Laravel teams. Maintained like it
                matters &mdash; because it does.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="reveal mt-10" style="--reveal-delay: 320ms">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
            Parts bin &mdash; selected packages
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <a
              href="https://github.com/octopyid/laravel-impersonate"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="work-card group p-4 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
            >
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-faint">PART N&ordm; 001</p>
              <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">laravel-impersonate</p>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Log in as any user, for Laravel apps.
              </p>
              <img
                src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/octopyid/laravel-impersonate?style=flat-square"
                alt="GitHub stars for laravel-impersonate"
                class="mt-3 h-5"
                loading="lazy"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'"
              />
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/octopyid/filament-palette"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="work-card group p-4 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
            >
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-faint">PART N&ordm; 002</p>
              <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">filament-palette</p>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Custom color palettes for FilamentPHP.
              </p>
              <img
                src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/octopyid/filament-palette?style=flat-square"
                alt="GitHub stars for filament-palette"
                class="mt-3 h-5"
                loading="lazy"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'"
              />
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/octopyid/filament-tabify"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="work-card group p-4 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
            >
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-faint">PART N&ordm; 003</p>
              <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">filament-tabify</p>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                Tabbed widgets for Filament dashboards.
              </p>
              <img
                src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/octopyid/filament-tabify?style=flat-square"
                alt="GitHub stars for filament-tabify"
                class="mt-3 h-5"
                loading="lazy"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p
          class="reveal mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-ink/15 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-xs text-ink-soft"
          style="--reveal-delay: 380ms"
        >
          <i class="ph-duotone ph-map-pin text-base text-marker"></i>
          Indonesia &mdash; working worldwide
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
